<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Infaq al-Maysur</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Infaq al-Maysur is a historical work by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/muhammad-bello">Muhammad Bello</a>, the second ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sokoto-caliphate">Sokoto Caliphate</a>. It recounts the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jihad">jihad</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/usman-dan-fodio">Usman dan Fodio</a> and the early history of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliphate</a>. It remains a primary source for the caliphate's early decades.</p></div>
